# Blockchain Chat Application 🚀

A decentralized messaging application built using Ethereum smart contracts with basic end-to-end encryption.

# 📸  Screenshot
p2.png

# 🔥 Features
- Send messages on blockchain
- MetaMask wallet integration
- Hardhat local blockchain
- End-to-End Encryption (basic)
- React frontend (ethers.js)


# 🛠 Tech Stack
- Solidity
- Hardhat
- React.js
- ethers.js
- Crypto-JS

# 1️⃣ Clone Project

git clone https://github.com/hackmadhav/blockchain-chat.git
cd blockchain-chat

# 2️⃣ Install Dependencies

# root
npm install

# frontend
cd client
npm install



# 3️⃣ Start Blockchain

cd ..
npx hardhat node


# 4️⃣ Deploy Smart Contract

open new terminal:

cd blockchain-chat
npx hardhat run scripts/deploy.js --network localhost

👉 Copy contract address


# 5️⃣ Update Contract Address

Go to:

client/src/App.js

const contractAddress = "YOUR_ADDRESS";


# 6️⃣ Start Frontend

cd client
npm start


# 🎯 Usage

1. Connect MetaMask  
2. Select Hardhat Local Network  
3. Enter receiver address  
4. Send message  
5. Load messages  


# ⚠️ Notes

- This project uses local blockchain (Hardhat)
- ETH used is  (testing purpose)
- Restarting node will reset accounts


